  "content": "<p><img alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1004/811/warlord_logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1408\" height=\"940\"><img src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1TuMYlrd5-0tAovpB4ppELNyieue05MXD/view?usp=drive_link\" alt=\"\"><img alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/740/990/genesislogo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2047\" height=\"572\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">被遗忘的故事</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1452/324/warlord_completed-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"590\" height=\"883\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">公告：我打算重做这个模组中的下界 warlord（暂译：下界霸主）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">将拥有全新的独特模型、技能等更多内容！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\">加入我们的 Discord 服务器！↓</span></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/XFfUjwD6xa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1006/433/3a8feb0e279d07a02c91451aebf4dba91263075a-1140x620.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1044\"></span></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">警告：这仍是测试</span><span style=\"color:#f00\">版本，距离完成还很远。</span></span></p><p>模组展示：</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RJU6lbceZug?si=MKdTQvK8uC3yR3rx\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px;color:#000\">使用 IntelliJ 重新制作</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000;font-family:&amp;#x27\">关于此模组的公告：下界霸主即将重做！</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">将包括新的模型/纹理、攻击方式，以及专属的新结构！</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">当前 Boss：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 三文鱼 Boss <span style=\"color:#f00\">（正在进行中）</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 下界霸主</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 不朽魔像</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 宇宙史蒂夫 <span style=\"color:#f00\">（正在进行中）</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">当前生物：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 下界幻影</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">当前结构：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 凋灵基地</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">当前物品：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 模组实体清除者</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 霸主生成器</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 霸主之锤</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 音乐唱片（Makai Symphony - Duel）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 各生物刷怪蛋</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">注意：<br>- 当你在充满回忆的世界中游玩时，建议将 <span style=\"color:#f00\">\"mobGriefing\"</span> 设置为 <span style=\"color:#f00\">\"false\"</span>。不朽魔像、宇宙史蒂夫等可以破坏相对柔软的方块（硬度低于矿石方块）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 不需要其他模组。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">鸣谢：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000;font-family:&amp;#x27\">不朽魔像纹理：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmob-skin%252fimmortal-totem%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/mob-skin/immortal-totem/</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000;font-family:&amp;#x27\">太阳光束代码：<a href=\"https://github.com/BobMowzie/MowziesMobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/BobMowzie/MowziesMobs</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掉落方块和 Boss 血量条代码：L_Ender's Cataclysm</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">下界霸主主题曲：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fTJL23TSToXk%253fsi%253dUhpYitAgL6eRXFnQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/TJL23TSToXk?si=UhpYitAgL6eRXFnQ</a></span></span></p>\n</div>",
